                        <span>7. Device Import / Export Architecture</span>
                        <span class="file-bracket">[<span class="b-file">Services/SpreadsheetService.cs</span> &bull; <span class="b-file">Controllers/DevicesController.cs</span> (<span class="b-action">Import, Export</span>) &bull; <span class="b-file">Views/Devices/Import.cshtml</span>]</span>
                    </h2>
                    <p class="sec-p">Bulk import pipeline for onboarding hundreds of devices from a single .xlsx or .csv file, with multi-stage review, conflict resolution, and atomic commit workflow.</p>
                    <h3 class="sec-h3">
                        <span>7.1 Import Pipeline &mdash; 7-Stage Flow</span>
                        <span class="file-bracket">[<span class="b-file">Services/SpreadsheetService.cs</span>: <span class="b-action">ParseImportedDevices()</span> &bull; <span class="b-file">Controllers/DevicesController.cs</span>]</span>
                    </h3>
                    <div class="tbl-wrap">
                        <table class="src-tbl">
                            <thead><tr><th>Stage</th><th>Process</th><th>Technical Detail</th><th>Controlling File</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr><td><strong>1 &mdash; Upload</strong></td><td>User uploads .xlsx or .csv via multipart POST</td><td>Extension validated. Max size: 50MB. Stream opened without disk buffering.</td><td><code>DevicesController.cs</code></td></tr>
                                <tr><td><strong>2 &mdash; Parse</strong></td><td><code>SpreadsheetService.ParseImportedDevices()</code></td><td>Case-insensitive header matching (sl_no, vehicle_no, imei, iccid&hellip;).</td><td><code>SpreadsheetService.cs</code></td></tr>
                                <tr><td><strong>3 &mdash; Slash Parse</strong></td><td>Each VehicleNo passed through <code>ParseVehicleSlash()</code></td><td>Handles 'KA35AB1234/KA01AB0001' &mdash; extracts primary vehicle, appends replacement history.</td><td><code>DevicesController.cs</code></td></tr>
                                <tr><td><strong>4 &mdash; Conflict Detect</strong></td><td>Each row checked against existing DB records</td><td>Conflict = existing device where BOTH Imei AND Iccid match.</td><td><code>SpreadsheetService.cs</code></td></tr>
                                <tr><td><strong>5 &mdash; Review Page</strong></td><td>User views ImportReview with new vs conflict counts</td><td>Per-row action selector (insert/replace/keep). Staged JSON in hidden form field.</td><td><code>Views/Devices/ImportReview.cshtml</code></td></tr>
                                <tr><td><strong>6 &mdash; Confirm</strong></td><td>User confirms per-row action decisions</td><td>RequestFormLimits configured for 100,000 form entries.</td><td><code>DevicesController.cs</code></td></tr>
                                <tr><td><strong>7 &mdash; Commit</strong></td><td>All inserts and replaces committed in single save</td><td>'keep'=skip. 'replace'=non-blank fields overwrite. 'insert'=new GUID + SlNo.</td><td><code>EfDataStore.cs</code></td></tr>
