                <!-- SEC 13 -->
                <section id="sec-13" class="src-section">
                    <div class="sec-label">Section 13.0</div>
                    <h2 class="sec-h2">
                        <span>13. Alert Feed &amp; WhatsApp Notification Engine</span>
                        <span class="file-bracket">[<span class="b-file">Controllers/AlertsController.cs</span> &bull; <span class="b-file">Views/Alerts/Index.cshtml</span> &bull; <span class="b-file">Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml</span>]</span>
                    </h2>
                    <p class="sec-p">Real-time JSON API <code>GET /Alerts/Feed</code> powers the navigation header notification drawer. Returns four alert categories with pre-formatted WhatsApp deeplinks.</p>
                    <h3 class="sec-h3">
                        <span>13.1 Real-Time Alert Categories &amp; Trigger Conditions</span>
                        <span class="file-bracket">[<span class="b-file">Controllers/AlertsController.cs</span>: <span class="b-action">Feed()</span> &bull; <span class="b-file">Services/DashboardService.cs</span>]</span>
                    </h3>
                    <div class="tbl-wrap">
                        <table class="src-tbl">
                            <thead><tr><th>Category</th><th>Trigger Condition</th><th>Visibility</th><th>Handler Action</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr><td><span class="br">Overdue Alerts</span></td><td>DaysPastExpiry in [1, 30] AND InformedDate &ne; today. Ordered by DPE descending.</td><td>Executive &amp; Admin only</td><td><code>AlertsController.Feed()</code></td></tr>
                                <tr><td><span class="ba">Expiring This Week</span></td><td>ExpiryDate within next 0&ndash;7 days AND InformedDate &ne; today. Ordered by DaysFromNow ascending.</td><td>Executive &amp; Admin only</td><td><code>AlertsController.Feed()</code></td></tr>
                                <tr><td><span class="bb">Lifecycle Shifts</span></td><td>Device recently (within 7 days) crossed Active&rarr;Suspension, Suspension&rarr;Terminated, or Terminated&rarr;Dead.</td><td>Executive &amp; Admin only</td><td><code>AlertsController.Feed()</code></td></tr>
                                <tr><td><span class="bg">Open Follow-Ups</span></td><td>Manual Reminders not complete, matching current user's branch and TargetAudience.</td><td>All users matching target</td><td><code>AlertsController.Feed()</code></td></tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="sec-h3">
                        <span>13.2 WhatsApp Deep Link Generation &amp; Phone Cleaning</span>
                        <span class="file-bracket">[<span class="b-file">Controllers/AlertsController.cs</span>: <span class="b-action">GenerateWhatsAppLink()</span>]</span>
                    </h3>
                    <ul class="sec-ul">
                        <li>Owner phone from <code>device.CellNo</code>: stripped to digits only. If exactly 10 digits &rarr; prefixed with '91'.</li>
                        <li>Vendor phone from <code>Vendors</code> table lookup by vendor name. Same cleaning applied. <span class="file-bracket">[<span class="b-file">Controllers/VendorsController.cs</span>]</span></li>
                        <li>URL format: <code>https://web.whatsapp.com/send?phone={phone}&amp;text={URLEncodedMessage}</code></li>
                        <li><strong>Mark Informed Action:</strong> POST <code>/Alerts/MarkInformed</code> sets <code>device.InformedDate = today (UTC)</code>, suppressing duplicate notifications for that day. <span class="file-bracket">[<span class="b-file">AlertsController.cs</span>: <span class="b-action">MarkInformed</span>]</span></li>
                    </ul>
                    <h3 class="sec-h3">
                        <span>13.3 Batch WhatsApp Renewal Composer &amp; Bilingual Engine</span>
                        <span class="file-bracket">[<span class="b-file">Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml</span> &bull; <span class="b-file">Controllers/VendorsController.cs</span>]</span>
                    </h3>
                    <ul class="sec-ul">
                        <li><strong>Vendor Mobile Phone Auto-Population:</strong> Selecting a vendor in the composer modal automatically fetches and injects their registered WhatsApp phone number from the <code>Vendors</code> directory, eliminating manual phone entry.</li>
