                        <li><strong>Bilingual Message Engine:</strong> Generates message text formatted in both <strong>English and Kannada (ಕನ್ನಡ)</strong>, with vehicle registration numbers, due dates, and payment instructions.</li>
                        <li><strong>Dispatch Actions:</strong> Direct WhatsApp Web link opening, clipboard copy, and formatted Excel export.</li>
