                <!-- SEC 23 -->
                <section id="sec-23" class="src-section">
                    <div class="sec-label">Section 23.0</div>
                    <h2 class="sec-h2">
                        <span>23. Enterprise Multi-Year Financial Architecture (Expenditure Branch)</span>
                        <span class="file-bracket">[<span class="b-file">Areas/Expenditure/*</span> &bull; <span class="b-file">Controllers/ExpensesController.cs</span> &bull; <span class="b-file">Controllers/TransactionsController.cs</span>]</span>
                    </h2>
                    <p class="sec-p">Enterprise cross-cutting accounting branch providing complete fiscal year segregation, capital asset depreciation, vendor procurement tracking, and dynamic cash flow consolidation across all company divisions.</p>
                    
                    <h3 class="sec-h3">
                        <span>23.1 Multi-Year Fiscal Segregation Engine</span>
                        <span class="file-bracket">[<span class="b-file">Areas/Expenditure/Controllers/PreviousYearsController.cs</span> &bull; <span class="b-file">Areas/Expenditure/Views/PreviousYears/Index.cshtml</span>]</span>
                    </h3>
                    <ul class="sec-ul">
                        <li><strong>Fiscal Year Partitions:</strong> Books are partitioned into <code>FY 2023-24</code> (2023-04-01 to 2024-03-31), <code>FY 2024-25</code> (2024-04-01 to 2025-03-31), <code>FY 2025-26</code> (Active Operating Year), and <code>FY 2026-27</code> (Advance Provisioning).</li>
                        <li><strong>Annual Financial Comparison Audit Summary:</strong> Single consolidated summary table rendering Direct Inflow, Branch Inflow, Total Combined Inflow, Total Outflow, Net Cash Flow, and total invoice/transaction counts per fiscal year.</li>
                        <li><strong>Direct Drill-Down Action:</strong> Operators click <code>Selected</code> or <code>View Records &rarr;</code> on any row to dynamically load and audit that year's archived books.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h3 class="sec-h3">
                        <span>23.2 Dynamic Inflow &amp; Cash Flow Aggregation Algorithm</span>
                        <span class="file-bracket">[<span class="b-file">Areas/Expenditure/Controllers/ExpensesController.cs</span>: <span class="b-action">Index, ComputeCashFlow</span>]</span>
                    </h3>
                    <div class="tbl-wrap">
                        <table class="src-tbl">
                            <thead><tr><th>Metric</th><th>Derivation Formula</th><th>Data Sources</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr><td><strong>Direct Inflow (&#8377;)</strong></td><td><code>&sum; (InvoiceRecord.TotalAmount) WHERE Branch='Expenditure' AND Type='Inflow'</code></td><td>Direct non-branch corporate revenue</td></tr>
                                <tr><td><strong>Branch Inflow (&#8377;)</strong></td><td><code>&sum; (TransactionRecord.Amount) WHERE Date &isin; [FY_Start, FY_End] AND Branch &isin; ['DMG', 'RTO']</code></td><td>Customer transactions from DMG &amp; RTO branches</td></tr>
                                <tr><td><strong>Combined Total Inflow (&#8377;)</strong></td><td><code>Direct Inflow + Branch Inflow</code></td><td>Consolidated total organizational cash intake</td></tr>
                                <tr><td><strong>Total Outflow (&#8377;)</strong></td><td><code>&sum; (InvoiceRecord.TotalAmount) WHERE Branch='Expenditure' AND Type='Outflow'</code></td><td>Hardware procurement, server hosting, SIM bulk refills</td></tr>
                                <tr><td><strong>Net Cash Flow (&#8377;)</strong></td><td><code>Combined Total Inflow - Total Outflow</code></td><td>Corporate net operating profit for the fiscal year</td></tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>

                    <h3 class="sec-h3">
                        <span>23.3 Archived Ledger &amp; Multi-Branch Filter Engine</span>
                        <span class="file-bracket">[<span class="b-file">Areas/Expenditure/Views/PreviousYears/Index.cshtml</span>]</span>
                    </h3>
                    <ul class="sec-ul">
                        <li><strong>Tabbed Ledger Navigation:</strong> Seamless switching between <em>Archived Invoices &amp; Proforma (PI)</em> and <em>Archived Branch Transactions</em>.</li>
                        <li><strong>Branch Filtering:</strong> Filter archived transactions by <em>All Branches</em>, <em>DMG Transactions</em>, or <em>RTO Transactions</em>.</li>
                        <li><strong>Date Range &amp; Search Constraints:</strong> Filter records by <code>fromDate</code>, <code>toDate</code>, and free-text vehicle/vendor search within the active fiscal year bounds.</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>
